  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "青春走佗位去？"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳俐雯</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一个望</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">恬靜tī夢中</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī hia就算風khau雨lâm</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">猶原花紅葉青</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青春原在</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一个夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">百年青春等候千年歲月ê溫柔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">愛tī春來冬去ê流擺翩翩起舞</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">情tī日光月夜ê浪漫交織意愛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Che iⁿ纏ê跤跡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一路向前</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行過少歲ê táng-hiaⁿh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">衝破罩bông ê年華</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一步一步hāⁿ過歲月ê山niā</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像欠啥mi̍h ê款</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青春用暝日ê khùi力tī歲月ê世界走揣siàu想ê夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē輸短短短ê一世人有用bē了ê時間</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ká-ná紅紅紅ê花蕊永遠lóng bē退色</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">哪ē知？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一下無張持</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">走精ê針tī重重疊疊ê歲數</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來來回回刺號、留khî</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">歲月ê chhoah流無聲無soeh tī青春ê面模</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無停無歇妝thāⁿ風霜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hō͘走形ê青春</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī纏纏ba̍t-ba̍t ê jiâu痕揣無tńg--去ê路</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拍茫ê驚惶點tuh變款ê未來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無thang pha碇ê心</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hē性命tī àu黃ê曆日走揣早時khēng ê色彩</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">綿爛tī目一nih ê瓊花等候永恆ê美麗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">按窗縫射--入-來ê日鬚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">弓開hit个無想beh醒--來ê夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">金金看伊無話無句一八liu-liu去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">想beh借問：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ta葉lian花kám iáu有ǹg望？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啊！原來青春是歲月ê祭品</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有啥人ē-tàng kā我講</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青春&nbsp; &nbsp; 到底是走佗位去？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjrldw8BuR87slPkQdfZoyGM9ehTQNQ7DhT5TWcTX2qc1X8mSbYvcg6ta1RgFQXqL9fcpHSt9ugTxZUKAo4nZPVMyDU2-WDMR_lBk1WlrZ96SjSlgVYC0_RltR6sD0DChXqgc2yjohFnjspg_H6_A3Tdbrl5Ry066HfZkDbB4l91b-SlLTb-dPctseBhg/s1424/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjrldw8BuR87slPkQdfZoyGM9ehTQNQ7DhT5TWcTX2qc1X8mSbYvcg6ta1RgFQXqL9fcpHSt9ugTxZUKAo4nZPVMyDU2-WDMR_lBk1WlrZ96SjSlgVYC0_RltR6sD0DChXqgc2yjohFnjspg_H6_A3Tdbrl5Ry066HfZkDbB4l91b-SlLTb-dPctseBhg/w450-h640/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhAnvWnjOVTkC86LLO6H-a-Z3sU7ZaOAzwJgthHPHXLRhcAuTwS5ek1cST__shpxXkLAAX7TTVkCyNPAayhaRXlUVOUhRKZwQap9EWb1X4MVvA0UJ-Ksek4cdw_uMu053ah9Ii8TaA5pKdMVk9Pfn1T30VtmFEzZrIFDZCI_bDSL0Chp8SvtfeEtUgmuQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1344%E6%9C%9F_042.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhAnvWnjOVTkC86LLO6H-a-Z3sU7ZaOAzwJgthHPHXLRhcAuTwS